        "raw": "<p>The short answer is yes. &nbsp;Start of turn effects that are played during start of turn trigger the same way that end of turn effects trigger when played at end of turn.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The longer answer is that start of turn effects and end of turn effects always trigger in the order that the cards came into play. &nbsp;So the Villain character card is always first, and then whatever was played next, then the one after that, etc. &nbsp;Since a just played card by definition came into play after the card that caused it to be played, it will still be in line to be triggered.</p>",
