        "raw": "<p>Also, if a villain flips during their Start phase and has Start phase actions on their flipped side, those will immediately trigger. For example, Dawn will flip and then flip straight back if enough Citizens are already out (which is why it&#39;s super-useful to make sure that&#39;s the case before you put the fifth Citizen in the trash ;)).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit - <em>Also</em> also, if a hero gets incapped during their Start phase (eg kills themselves via Infection) they will still get to use their Incap ability, as an incapped hero&#39;s turn now has the phases Start, Use Incap Ability, and End :).</p>",
